Golang
-------
This repository is using to explore and learn Golang language.


Projects
---------

* auth-service: microservice using for user administration and authentication.

* basics: scripts doing simple things

* watcher: program to verify and notify if a website and k8s cluster is not working/running properly or if any file in a list was modified (running as a daemon)

* product-tracking: program to track product prices on websites (running as a daemon)
